                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="communicating with “spirits,” when once his consent is given, he becomes"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l5" HPOS="419" VPOS="712" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="419 750 2187 750" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 750 419 761 2183 763 2187 750 2185 712 419 712 419 750"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="impatient, and hurries his assistants and listeners. He wishes to begin and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l6" HPOS="417" VPOS="767" WIDTH="803" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="419 804 1220 808" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 804 417 820 430 828 432 828 434 828 436 828 1218 820 1220 808 1220 781 1184 769 1182 769 1180 769 1028 779 744 779 734 769 734 767 732 767 730 767 728 767 419 775 419 804"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="to be through as soon as possible."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l7" HPOS="526" VPOS="824" WIDTH="1661" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="528 863 2187 867" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="528 863 526 879 536 887 538 887 540 887 542 887 1343 879 1355 889 1357 889 1359 889 1361 889 2185 879 2187 867 2185 838 2050 826 2048 826 2046 826 2013 836 1948 826 1946 826 1901 836 1876 826 1874 826 1768 826 1766 826 1764 826 1762 826 1750 836 1709 826 1707 826 1705 826 1703 826 1672 836 1396 826 1394 826 1392 826 1369 836 1337 824 1335 824 1333 824 1286 834 1208 824 1206 824 1204 824 1173 834 1135 824 1133 824 1132 824 1079 836 983 836 967 824 965 824 963 824 961 824 959 824 928 834 851 824 850 824 848 824 818 834 789 824 787 824 785 824 724 834 528 828 528 863"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="I was told that the application of cold water to the head of a shaman"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l8" HPOS="417" VPOS="885" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="419 924 2187 928" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 924 417 936 442 947 444 947 446 947 2185 940 2187 928 2185 898 2060 887 2058 887 1927 896 1905 887 1903 887 1901 887 1899 887 1870 896 1848 887 1846 887 1844 887 1786 896 1727 887 1725 887 1647 896 1615 887 1613 887 1611 887 1609 887 1576 896 1551 887 1549 887 1547 887 1484 896 1423 887 1421 887 1359 896 1104 885 1102 885 1100 885 1061 894 965 885 963 885 861 896 767 896 752 885 750 885 748 885 746 885 744 885 716 894 419 891 419 924"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="in the very heat of his performance would suddenly bring his inspiration to"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l9" HPOS="419" VPOS="947" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="419 987 2189 987" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 987 419 1002 2189 1002 2189 987 2189 957 2164 947 2162 947 2160 947 2158 947 2130 959 2023 959 2007 947 2005 947 2003 947 2001 947 1999 947 1958 957 1613 947 1611 947 1406 957 1353 947 1351 947 1282 957 1188 947 1186 947 1184 947 1182 947 1167 959 1079 959 1022 947 1020 947 865 957 658 947 656 947 654 947 613 957 575 947 573 947 571 947 419 957 419 987"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="an end. Therefore sometimes, during the ceremonials, if some performer is"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l10" HPOS="419" VPOS="1008" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="419 1049 2185 1049" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 1049 419 1071 2185 1071 2185 1049 2185 1018 2154 1008 2152 1008 2150 1008 2062 1018 1351 1008 1349 1008 1257 1018 1204 1008 1202 1008 1200 1008 1198 1008 1182 1020 838 1020 767 1008 765 1008 763 1008 761 1008 746 1020 642 1020 530 1008 528 1008 419 1018 419 1049"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="practising too long, or seems to be excited to a somewhat dangerous pitch,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l11" HPOS="417" VPOS="1071" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="419 1104 2187 1108" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 1104 417 1118 2183 1122 2187 1108 2185 1073 419 1071 419 1104"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="his neighbors may sprinkle him with water in order to bring him back to himself."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l12" HPOS="530" VPOS="1124" WIDTH="1657" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="532 1163 2187 1169" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="532 1163 530 1176 546 1186 548 1186 550 1186 552 1186 2185 1180 2187 1169 2187 1139 2146 1128 2144 1128 2142 1128 1831 1137 1780 1128 1778 1128 1776 1128 1741 1137 1400 1137 1384 1126 1382 1126 1380 1126 1378 1126 1333 1135 1286 1126 1284 1126 1229 1135 1063 1124 1061 1124 1008 1133 975 1124 973 1124 971 1124 969 1124 940 1133 532 1128 532 1163"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The performance itself is considered as a recovery from illness. The"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l13" HPOS="419" VPOS="1198" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="419 1227 2189 1227" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 1227 419 1239 2187 1241 2189 1227 2189 1198 419 1198 419 1227"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="same shaman who was nervous before the performance regains after it his"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l14" HPOS="417" VPOS="1253" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="419 1282 2189 1288" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 1282 417 1296 2185 1302 2189 1288 2187 1259 419 1253 419 1282"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="self-possession, and looks really as if he were braced up by some strong tonic."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l15" HPOS="421" VPOS="1310" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="421 1347 2189 1347" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="421 1347 421 1359 2185 1363 2189 1347 2187 1312 421 1310 421 1347"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Even the physical fatigue is in most cases quite unnoticeable. “Why should"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l16" HPOS="423" VPOS="1363" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="423 1404 2187 1408" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="423 1404 423 1417 1239 1417 1310 1427 1312 1427 2185 1417 2187 1408 2187 1376 2158 1364 2156 1364 2154 1364 2152 1364 2125 1374 2103 1364 2101 1364 2099 1364 2046 1374 1927 1364 1925 1364 1839 1374 1797 1364 1795 1364 1794 1364 1731 1374 1639 1364 1637 1364 1635 1364 1594 1374 1439 1364 1437 1364 1435 1364 1433 1364 1417 1376 1316 1376 1284 1363 1282 1363 1280 1363 1278 1363 1249 1372 1159 1363 1157 1363 1155 1363 1133 1372 1114 1363 1112 1363 1110 1363 1004 1372 930 1363 928 1363 926 1363 887 1372 873 1363 871 1363 869 1363 867 1363 865 1363 840 1372 783 1363 781 1363 716 1372 423 1366 423 1404"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="I feel fatigued?” asked a Chukchee shaman in regard to this subject. “I do"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l17" HPOS="417" VPOS="1423" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="419 1464 2187 1468" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 1464 417 1478 428 1486 430 1486 432 1486 434 1488 599 1488 599 1486 601 1486 603 1486 616 1476 677 1486 679 1486 761 1476 818 1486 820 1486 947 1476 1098 1486 1100 1486 1102 1486 1124 1476 1478 1488 1480 1488 1547 1478 1656 1488 1658 1490 1880 1490 1880 1488 1882 1488 1884 1488 1899 1478 2183 1484 2187 1468 2185 1439 2050 1425 2048 1425 2046 1425 2011 1437 1950 1425 1948 1425 1946 1425 1909 1437 1844 1425 1842 1425 1841 1425 1797 1435 1745 1425 1743 1425 1741 1425 1690 1437 1623 1425 1621 1425 1619 1425 1572 1437 1557 1425 1555 1425 1553 1425 1551 1425 1494 1435 1457 1425 1455 1425 1453 1425 1314 1437 1280 1423 1278 1423 1276 1423 1275 1423 1237 1435 1206 1423 1204 1423 1202 1423 1200 1423 1149 1435 1075 1423 1073 1423 998 1435 953 1423 951 1423 859 1423 857 1423 855 1423 832 1435 714 1423 712 1423 646 1437 564 1437 538 1423 536 1423 534 1423 419 1433 419 1464"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="nothing. The ‘spirits’ make all the exertion.” Accordingly, the former,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l18" HPOS="417" VPOS="1486" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="419 1527 2183 1523" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 1527 419 1543 2181 1539 2183 1523 2179 1486 1300 1486 1298 1486 1204 1496 528 1488 526 1488 417 1498 419 1527"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="constraint gives place to an exaggerated self-conceit, and even the most “bashful”"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l19" HPOS="419" VPOS="1554" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="421 1582 2189 1586" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="421 1582 419 1596 1386 1609 1388 1609 2187 1599 2189 1586 2187 1558 421 1554 421 1582"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of the young shamans are wont, after a performance, to magnify their own"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l20" HPOS="415" VPOS="1603" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="417 1643 2187 1646" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="417 1643 415 1656 2183 1660 2187 1646 2185 1617 2126 1605 2125 1605 2048 1615 1862 1605 1860 1605 1766 1615 1725 1605 1723 1605 1721 1605 1631 1615 1604 1605 1602 1605 1600 1605 1543 1615 1457 1605 1455 1605 1318 1615 1222 1603 1220 1603 1167 1613 417 1605 417 1643"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="‘faculties and shamanistic powers. Every one of them is ready to offer a repetition"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l21" HPOS="421" VPOS="1666" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="421 1705 2187 1705" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="421 1705 421 1719 2185 1721 2187 1705 2187 1676 2144 1666 2142 1666 2140 1666 2138 1666 2109 1676 2095 1666 2093 1666 2091 1666 2089 1666 2042 1676 2003 1666 2001 1666 1999 1666 1997 1666 1964 1676 1862 1666 1860 1666 1858 1666 1856 1666 1841 1678 1739 1678 1701 1666 1700 1666 1698 1666 1594 1676 1545 1666 1543 1666 1474 1676 1416 1666 1414 1666 1359 1676 1325 1666 1323 1666 1322 1666 1214 1676 1149 1666 1147 1666 1057 1676 889 1666 887 1666 885 1666 865 1676 834 1666 832 1666 830 1666 658 1676 622 1666 620 1666 618 1666 562 1676 458 1666 456 1666 454 1666 421 1676 421 1705"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of the seance, and, if taken at his word, will really again go through all the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l22" HPOS="421" VPOS="1729" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="423 1762 2187 1766" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="423 1762 421 1776 2183 1780 2187 1766 2183 1729 423 1731 423 1762"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="violence and madness. In some cases, especially in the matches between rival"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-161_l23" HPOS="421" VPOS="1786" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="421 1825 2185 1825" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="421 1825 421 1840 2183 1844 2185 1825 2185 1795 2156 1786 2154 1786 2152 1786 2105 1795 2077 1786 2076 1786 2074 1786 1993 1795 1696 1786 1694 1786 1484 1795 1431 1786 1429 1786 1427 1786 1425 1786 1410 1797 1273 1797 1214 1786 1212 1786 1149 1795 1051 1786 1049 1786 902 1795 808 1786 806 1786 714 1795 661 1786 660 1786 562 1795 446 1786 444 1786 442 1786 421 1795 421 1825"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="shamans, the performance will last for more than twenty-four hours, and finally"/>
