                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="419 2424 419 2438 2185 2438 2187 2424 2187 2397 2162 2385 2160 2385 2158 2385 2068 2395 1997 2385 1995 2385 1993 2385 1966 2395 1913 2385 1911 2385 1909 2385 1874 2395 1727 2385 1725 2385 1723 2385 1721 2385 1705 2397 1594 2397 1541 2385 1539 2385 1537 2385 1494 2395 1408 2385 1406 2385 1341 2395 1128 2385 1126 2385 787 2395 722 2385 720 2385 658 2395 577 2385 575 2385 495 2395 444 2385 442 2385 440 2385 419 2395 419 2424"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the spirits with more ease and freedom. The shaman sits on the “master’s"/>
                    </TextLine>

